timeline.body:
This is used for inter-node communication. We can't not just simply add or remove parameters here as nodes can be on different versions.  You need to add a new transport version.  Check `TransportVersion.java` for file how new transport versions are introduced and used. For example:

If you introduce a new transport version:
```java
public static final TransportVersion HIGHLIGHTERS_TAGS_ON_FIELD_LEVEL = def(8_626_00_0);
``` 
then you can use it here:
```java
 if (in.getTransportVersion()..onOrAfter(TransportVersions.HIGHLIGHTERS_TAGS_ON_FIELD_LEVEL)) {
  encoder(in.readOptionalString());
}
```

